South-West Development Commission (Establishment) Act, 2025 - Section 7: Functions of the Commission
Part II - Functions and Powers of the Commission
(1) The Commission shall —
(a) formulate policies and guidelines for the development of the South-West states;
(b) plan and execute infrastructural, agricultural, industrial, transportation, and ecological projects;
(c) rehabilitate damages to infrastructure and stimulate economic growth in the South-West zone.
